      },
      {
        "number": 23,
        "question": "What is the purpose of helm dependency update?",
        "answer": "The helm dependency update command resolves and downloads the dependencies declared by a chart into its charts directory and updates dependency metadata.\n\nCharts may depend on other charts to provide reusable components. Dependency management allows a parent chart to include those components in its deployment.\n\nFor example, an application chart may depend on a database chart. The dependency update operation retrieves the declared dependency versions so the parent chart can be packaged or rendered."
      },
      {
        "number": 24,
        "question": "What is the purpose of helm get values?",
