      },
      {
        "number": 25,
        "question": "What is a Time series panel in Grafana?",
        "answer": "A Time series panel displays values over time. It is commonly used for CPU utilization, memory usage, request rates, latency, and network traffic. Engineers can identify when a metric spike began."
      },
      {
        "number": 26,
        "question": "What is dashboard sharing in Grafana?",
